      "mode": 0,
      "title": "Recommended — ZavyFantasiaXL (Pony) + Hi-Res",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["## ZavyFantasiaXL - PDXL (Pony/SDXL)\n**Tuned for RTX 2060 SUPER 8GB / 16GB RAM**\n\n### Pipeline\n1. **CLIP Set Last Layer = -2** (Pony recommended skip)\n2. **Pass 1** KSampler @ 1024 — full 25 steps\n3. **Latent upscale 1.5x** -> 1536\n4. **Pass 2** KSampler — denoise **0.45**, 14 steps (hi-res fix: adds real detail, fixes soft 1024 output)\n5. **VAE Decode Tiled** — avoids OOM on 8GB at 1536\n\n### Why each setting\n- CFG **6.0**, dpmpp_2m + karras = Pony sweet spot\n- Both samplers share the same **seed** (pass2 = fixed) so the refine matches the base composition\n- Tiled VAE (tile 512) keeps decode under VRAM\n\n### Pony prompting\nPositive must start: `score_9, score_8_up, score_7_up, ...`\nNegative must start: `score_6, score_5, score_4, ...`\n\n### Speed / memory\n~15-25s/image on your card. If you ever OOM: drop upscale to 1280, or set Pass-2 denoise lower. For a fast draft, **bypass** (Ctrl+B) the two hi-res nodes (id 21 & 22) and wire Pass-1 latent straight to VAE.\n\nOutput -> `ComfyUI/output/`"]
,
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
